Infuse magic into your shadows to give them fearsome spells. Your shadows receive a bonus of [3, 6, 9, 12, 15 (TL1-5)] to their Spellpower.

Your shadows can strike adjacent foes with Lightning (level [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)], [6%, 10%, 12%, 14%, 15% (TL1-5)] chance at range 1).

At level 3 your shadows can sear their enemies from a distance with Flames (level [0, 0, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)], [0%, 0%, 12%, 14%, 15% (TL1-5)] chance at range 2 to 6).

At level 5 when your shadows are struck down they will attempt to Reform, becoming whole again (50% chance).
